{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-409",
  "title": "Layout DSL",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Layout DSL"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here’s the landscape:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Page description & layout engines (geometry-first)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "PostScript/PDF/SVG — exact geometry, zero semantic notion of “grid”."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "LaTeX + packages (KOMA, flowfram) — strong typographic primitives, ad-hoc grids."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "XSL-FO / CSS Paged Media — declarative frames/regions, page masters; good for books, not a general grid ontology."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Web layout languages"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "CSS Grid/Flexbox — expressive grid math (tracks, gutters, areas) and named lines; again, semantics live in class names, not the language."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Paged.js/Prince — bring CSS to paged media; still layout, not ontology."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Constraint systems (model structure, solve geometry)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Apple Auto Layout (VFL), Android ConstraintLayout, Cassowary/kiwi, GSS — constraints are great for composition rules; no shared vocabulary for “manuscript vs modular grid”."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. GUI and declarative UI DSLs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "QML/SwiftUI/Jetpack Compose/Svelte layout primitives — expressive, but each is a local dialect."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Document structure ontologies (semantics-first)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "DocBook/TEI/HTML sections, schema.org/DoCO (Document Components Ontology) — rich semantics for parts (chapter/figure/table), almost no grid specification."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-20",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "OCR/archival layout schemas (ALTO XML, PAGE XML) — regions, baselines, reading order; rudimentary grid hints at best."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Graph/layout DSLs (different domain)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-23",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Graphviz DOT, TikZ — powerful geometry, not typographic grid vocabularies."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What *does* exist as a de-facto taxonomy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-26",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "In typography: manuscript grid, column grid, modular grid, hierarchical grid; baseline grids; terms like margin, columns, gutters, alleys, modules, spatial zones, rhythm unit, cap-height, baseline, leading. Useful, but not machine-standardized."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If you want a practical “ontology”, you’ll need a thin schema that bridges (semantics ↔ math) and compiles to CSS/FO/AutoLayout/whatever. Minimal workable core:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Page: size, units, margins, bleed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Grid:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- type: manuscript | column | modular | hierarchical"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- columns: n, gutter"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- rows: n, gutter (optional unless modular)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- baseline: step, phase, snap: cap|x-height|baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- modules: width = (page.width − margins − (n−1)*gutter)/n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Zones (semantic regions): name, spans (colStart..colEnd, rowStart..rowEnd), alignment, flow (stack, grid, text), constraints (min/max, aspect, keep-with-next)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-38",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Typo system: type scales, line length bounds (ch), leading rules, widow/orphan rules."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-39",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Composition rules: “title sits in zone A, aligns left, snaps to baseline”, “images prefer right column, bleed on cover”, etc."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Example (compact, YAML-ish):"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "page:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "size: A4 landscape"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "margins: {top: 7mm, right: 7mm, bottom: 7mm, left: 7mm}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "grid:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type: modular"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "columns: {count: 12, gutter: 4.5mm}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "rows:    {count: 12, gutter: 4.5mm}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "baseline: {step: 4.5mm, snap: baseline}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "zones:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- id: masthead"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "span: {cols: [1,12], rows: [1,2]}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "flow: text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- id: hero"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "span: {cols: [7,12], rows: [3,12]}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "flow: image"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- id: body"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "span: {cols: [1,6], rows: [3,12]}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "flow: text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "typography:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "scale: major-third"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "body: {family: 'Inter', size: 10pt, leading: 14pt, measure: [55ch, 75ch]}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "rules:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- keepTogether: {selector: 'h1 + p', lines: 3}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- snapToBaseline: ['body', 'h1', 'h2']"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This can compile to:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-69",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "CSS Grid + custom properties (web), plus a baseline-snap helper."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-70",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "XSL-FO (paged PDF)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-71",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Auto Layout constraints (screen decks)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Blunt take: if you want a portable, high-level language for layouts like your screenshot, you’ll have to define it (small, opinionated), then write 2–3 solid backends. Start with CSS Grid + paged media; add FO later. I can sketch a concrete schema and a CSS compiler if you want to run with it."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}